#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""tend-your-agent-task (tyat) 🌱 — tend your tasks and your agent sessions.  (command: tyat, alias t)

  t                     board + ▶ NEXT recommendation; enter does it
  t now                 just do the top recommendation (jump to waiting session / start the due task)
  t add <text> [@folder] [when] [!|!!|!!!] [est:20m] [reach:1-5]   capture (when: today|tomorrow|mon..sun|14:00|2h|3d|2026-11-02|02.11.)
  t go <id> [assistant] start/resume the task's session in its folder; `?` = show the chooser
                        assistant: claude | codex | kit:<name> | gemini | grok   (--new = fresh session)
  t open [name]         fuzzy-pick a project folder → cd + start or resume a session there
  t recent              fuzzy-pick a recent conversation → cd + resume it (or jump if it is live)
  t handoffs [days]     where every project stands: newest HANDOFF*.md per project + its next step
  t page                HTML "what next" page: tasks + publishing calendar ranked by value ÷ effort,
                        split into a prep block and a do block learned from your own active hours
  t page --publish      + phone plan (PWA, German voice briefing per block) → wrangler deploy behind the key guard
                        [--no-voice] [--no-deploy]; folder: $TYAT_PLAN (default ./pub-plan)
                        task tokens it reads: est:20m|2h (effort)  reach:1-5 (how many people it moves)
  t report              today since 05:00: done, overdue, due ≤24h, prompts after the stop (also on the phone plan)
  t inbox [--claude]    fetch feedback recorded or typed on the phone plan, transcribe, append to inbox.md;
                        --claude opens a session that turns it into t done/next/snooze/add
  t me [<id> 1|0]       steps only you can do (send, post, call, approve, pay …); 1|0 overrides the guess
                        (task token me:1|me:0; on the phone plan: the 👤 filter)
  t fix <id> [0]        fixed appointment: t check never moves it, asks if it happened (0 = movable again)
  t dl <id> <when>|-    real deadline: no move or slot may pass it (due is just the planned slot)
  t sync                apply ticks from the phone plan: ticked task → done, unticked → reopened
                        (the notifier does this every 2 min; TYAT_TICKSYNC=0 turns it off)
  t check [--apply]     a small model (TYAT_SLM, default claude:haiku) reads commits, handoffs and session
                        transcripts of the last 72h → which tasks are done; late tasks move into free slots.
                        --apply writes it (log: .check.log); TYAT_AUTOCHECK=1: notifier runs it at 22:00, 12:00, stop
  t <n>                 jump to session n (brings its iTerm tab to front)
  t done <id>           finish            t next <id> <text>   set next step
  t snooze <id> <when>  push due          t rm <id>            delete
  t edit                open tasks.md     t notify             one notification pass (LaunchAgent)
  t help / t --version
  t install             link `t` into ~/.local/bin + install the notifier LaunchAgent
"""
